=== AC1a: foreign-pid injection via `adb shell log -p e -t flutter` ===
$ adb -s emulator-5554 shell log -p e -t flutter "NEARS-1783-QA-FOREIGN-PID-INJECTION [ERR] should be excluded"

Raw uncleared buffer (proves the injected line IS present, under a distinct pid 19186 != app pid 18855):
08-21 00:29:12.350 19186 19186 E flutter : NEARS-1783-QA-FOREIGN-PID-INJECTION [ERR] should be excluded

New (worktree) pid-bound ui_errors immediately after injection:
ui_errors: emulator-5554 scanned 52 flutter-tag lines for pid 18855 (com.izzes.nears) of 259 pid-scoped buffer lines; 0 match(es). ...
exit=0

-> foreign pid's injected [ERR] line did NOT flip the match count (still 0, same as pre-injection baseline). CONFIRMED excluded.

Contrast — OLD-style unscoped scan (same tag/sel regex as pre-1783 ui_errors, run directly against the whole buffer with no --pid):
matches count: 3
08-21 00:29:12.350 19186 19186 E flutter : NEARS-1783-QA-FOREIGN-PID-INJECTION [ERR] should be excluded

-> the injected foreign-pid line WOULD have counted under the old unscoped scan. Proves the fix actually closes the gap (not just "still passes because nothing changed").

